            <description><![CDATA[<h2>RestinPID 3.1</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Appearance:</b> choose System, Light or Dark in Settings → General.</li>
<li><b>Update schedule:</b> check every day, week, two weeks, month, or never, in Settings → Updates. You can also let updates download and install by themselves.</li>
<li><b>See updates at a glance:</b> when a new version is out, a dot appears on the menu bar icon, a banner appears at the top of the panel, and you get a notification. Click any of them to read what’s new before installing.</li>
</ul>
